      "pair_identity": "Define pair_tuple=RFC8785_JCS({\"stage\":\"HELDOUT_TEXT\",\"external_life_namespace\":external_life_namespace,\"origin_branch\":origin_branch,\"slot\":slot}) and pair_sha256=lowerhex(SHA256(UTF8(pair_tuple))). The exact opportunity IDs are ASCII(\"P1F-OP-DREAM-\")||pair_sha256 and ASCII(\"P1F-OP-SELF_CHECK-\")||pair_sha256. Reject any pair_sha256 collision across unequal pair_tuple bytes. The pair entries therefore share byte-identical stage, external life, origin branch, and slot and differ only in profile; the SELF_CHECK row's cause_opportunity_id is the exact P1F-OP-DREAM- partner wherever a DREAM-result-specific or dispatched-upstream-infrastructure route applies.",
